      <activity id="b84c66c4-9cca-5dd3-85ff-1c9b561697cc" activityNameId="9aac1635-01d8-5eab-91d7-2512771d4c82" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Inverter, 500W, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Inverter, 500W, at plant
Production of an inverter (500W) with an efficiency of 93.5% (total efficiency factor which includes MPP-Tracking) for photovoltaic plant. Total weight about 1.6 kg.;
Synonyms: inverse rectifier; 
UUID: ac149637-98f4-3f52-8b98-a9e168c40c40
Materials, packaging and electricity use for the production of an inverse rectifier. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: Production in RER.
Technology: Inverter for a photovoltaic grid-connected system with a capacity of 500Wp.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product 
Extrapolations: Packaging materials and energy consumption during production has been scaled down from 2500 W-Inverter.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ac149637-98f4-3f52-8b98-a9e168c40c40.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
